<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<title><%= titulo %> · Painel SOBRAEP</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/images/favicon-32.png">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/fonts/fonts.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin.css">
</head>
<body class="admin-body">
<header class="admin-topbar">
  <div class="admin-topbar-inner">
    <a href="/admin/noticias" class="admin-brand">
      <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="SOBRAEP">
      <span>Painel</span>
    </a>
    <nav class="admin-nav">
      <a href="/admin/noticias" class="<%= aba === 'noticias' ? 'is-active' : '' %>">Notícias</a>
      <a href="/admin/webinars" class="<%= aba === 'webinars' ? 'is-active' : '' %>">Webinars</a>
      <a href="/admin/arquivos" class="<%= aba === 'arquivos' ? 'is-active' : '' %>">Arquivos</a>
      <a href="/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ver site ↗</a>
      <form action="/admin/logout" method="post" class="admin-logout-form">
        <button type="submit">Sair</button>
      </form>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="admin-aviso-propagacao">
  ⏳ Após salvar, a alteração aparece no site em cerca de <strong>1 minuto</strong>. Se não aparecer de imediato, aguarde e atualize a página — o conteúdo <strong>não</strong> se perde.
</div>
<main class="admin-main">
